(text "GND = hot logic ground = motor bus negative" (at 175.1 95.92 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 24b12c3c-3c2e-4625-8bba-82d4d9c25c1d))
(text "isolated front-panel supply (CN300)" (at 202.5 108.62 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9) italic) (justify left top)) (uuid 3b82ee1d-cdce-490b-843a-8a36cd8a7870))
(text "NOTES  (structure confirmed; transformer pin-out and several values NOT traced; ? = value not read)\n- Fed from mains BEFORE the relays (it must power the MCU before RY200/RY202 close). Exact tap (before/after L103) not confirmed; drawn after L103.\n- F101 T1 A; Z101 varistor position empty on this board; IC100 Panasonic MIP2E3D (forum reports MIP2E1D on 230 V boards); T100 marked D1D8A.\n- Feedback: PC100 + IC200 TL431 regulate the hot-side +5V.  Clamp ZD101/D104, the aux winding and the IC100 pin-out are drawn functionally (DX5 = aux rectifier).\n- Hot-side outputs are referenced to GND (= motor bus negative = MCU ground).  The cold output (VCOLD / GND_COLD) is the only isolated rail." (at 15.24 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8aae8a92-5a8b-4aa1-aa15-5395d0faf5be))
)